    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey there \ud83d\udc4b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm Blu, and this is my <strong>first ever game</strong> \u2014 made with zero game dev experience, just a lot of curiosity and late nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apartment 22</strong> is a bite-sized horror game where you play as a detective trapped in a time loop inside a strange apartment. You\u2019ll search for clues left behind by someone else\u2026 or maybe by yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is a little different. The more you play, the more you start to uncover what\u2019s really going on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It won\u2019t take much of your time \u2014 but it just might stick in your head longer than you expect.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844550/extras/90189d816cccdd4b8d212a64aae65e83.poster.avif?t=1752810613\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844550/extras/90189d816cccdd4b8d212a64aae65e83.webm?t=1752810613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844550/extras/90189d816cccdd4b8d212a64aae65e83.mp4?t=1752810613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey there \ud83d\udc4b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm Blu, and this is my <strong>first ever game</strong> \u2014 made with zero game dev experience, just a lot of curiosity and late nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apartment 22</strong> is a bite-sized horror game where you play as a detective trapped in a time loop inside a strange apartment. You\u2019ll search for clues left behind by someone else\u2026 or maybe by yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is a little different. The more you play, the more you start to uncover what\u2019s really going on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It won\u2019t take much of your time \u2014 but it just might stick in your head longer than you expect.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844550/extras/90189d816cccdd4b8d212a64aae65e83.poster.avif?t=1752810613\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844550/extras/90189d816cccdd4b8d212a64aae65e83.webm?t=1752810613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844550/extras/90189d816cccdd4b8d212a64aae65e83.mp4?t=1752810613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
